Section 3.
After the ratification of the creation of such municipality in a plebiscite, the mayor and the members of the Sangguniang Bayan of the new Municipality of Sto. Niño shall be appointed by the President (Prime Minister), and shall hold office until their successors shall have been elected and qualified in the regular election for local officials.
Section 4.
The Commission on Elections shall conduct and supervise the plebiscite mentioned in Section one hereof, which shall be held within one hundred twenty (120) days upon the approval of this Act. The expenses for such plebiscite shall be paid out of the appropriations provided for in the General Appropriations Act for the Commission on Elections:
Provided,
That the amount spent in excess of that which the Commission on Elections can provide will be borne by the local government unit concerned.
Section 5.
This Act shall take effect upon its approval.
Approved: December 23, 1980
